  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STREAM EU- Extending Social Protection to Migrant Workers and their Families in the Arab Gulf Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Migrant workers and their families have access in law and in practice to their human right to social protection without discrimination (i.e. employment injury, unemployment, end-of-service indemnities, medical, and maternity benefits) making them resilient to risks and shocks across their lives and work transitions.Migrant workers and their families have access in law and in practice to their human right to social protection without discrimination (i.e. employment injury, unemployment, end-of-service indemnities, medical, and maternity benefits) making them resilient to risks and shocks across their lives and work transitions.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
